 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "先看一个示例场景。",
   "spoken": "先看一个示例场景。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "管理员的钱包，打开了一个钓鱼页面。",
   "spoken": "管理员的钱包，打开了一个钓鱼页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 3.34,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 3.435,
   "speechEnd": 6.892
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "他以为自己在领空投，实际调用了攻击者的合约。",
   "spoken": "他以为自己在领空投，实际掉用了攻击者的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 7.32,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 7.32,
   "speechEnd": 11.743
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "攻击者的合约，紧接着去调用你的金库。",
   "spoken": "攻击者的合约，紧接着去掉用你的金库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 12.18,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 12.274,
   "speechEnd": 15.477
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "金库的权限检查只有一句：交易的发起人，必须是管理员。",
   "spoken": "金库的权限检查只有一句：交易的发起人，必须是管理员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 15.92,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 16.012,
   "speechEnd": 21.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "这次调用，能通过吗？",
   "spoken": "这次掉用，能通过吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 21.58,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 21.58,
   "speechEnd": 23.223
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "能。",
   "spoken": "能。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 23.92,
   "dur": 0.56,
   "speechStart": 23.92,
   "speechEnd": 24.299
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "这句检查读的是 tx.origin，也就是发起整笔交易的那个外部账户。",
   "spoken": "这句检查读的是 tx.origin，也就是发起整笔交易的那个外部账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 24.7,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 24.7,
   "speechEnd": 33.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "在这里，就是被骗的管理员。中间经过多少个合约，它都不变。",
   "spoken": "在这里，就是被骗的管理员。中间经过多少个合约，它都不变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 33.56,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 33.56,
   "speechEnd": 39.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "攻击者没有偷私钥。他借用了管理员的身份。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没有偷私钥。他借用了管理员的身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 39.78,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 39.872,
   "speechEnd": 43.225
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "要看懂这一步，先要看懂这台机器，EVM。",
   "spoken": "要看懂这一步，先要看懂这台机器，EVM。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 43.68,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 43.68,
   "speechEnd": 48.153
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "这一集讲三件事：谁在调用，数据存在哪，语言里有哪些坑。",
